---
face_parsing_segface_mobilenet_512.onnx: SegFace (https://github.com/Kartik-3004/SegFace, commit 9416628),
MobileNetV3 backbone, CelebAMask-HQ weights (huggingface.co/kartiknarayan/SegFace, mobilenet_celeba_512/model_299.pt),
exported to ONNX (opset 17, output = softmax probabilities of the 19 CelebAMask-HQ classes).
The weights were trained on CelebAMask-HQ, whose dataset terms allow non-commercial research use only;
this project uses them for personal, non-commercial use.
